    <briefdescription>
<para>Simple chooser option. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This option gives the holder the right to choose, at a future date prior to exercise, whether the option should be a call or a put. The exercise date and strike are the same for both call and put option. </para>    </detaileddescription>
